OL,3,APrisoners freed early are returning to
OL,4,Ajail at rapid rate, governors tell BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrisoners who were freed under the
OL,7,Fgovernment's last early release scheme
OL,8,Fare returning to jail at a rapid rate,
OL,9,Fprison governors have told the BBC.
OL,11,FThey say they are seeing the same
OL,12,Finmates, who were let out as part of
OL,13,Fthe 2024 early release scheme to ease
OL,14,Fovercrowding, coming back after
OL,15,Freoffending - including for breaching
OL,16,Ftheir conditions.
OL,18,F"The churn is what stresses me out,"
OL,19,Fsaid one governor in the Midlands,
OL,20,Fdescribing it as a "revolving door".
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
