OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUS strikes Iranian launchers on Larak
OL,4,AIsland in first known attack in weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe IRGC said Sunday's attack killed
OL,7,Fand wounded several people, and vowed
OL,8,F"response and punishment". It later
OL,9,Fsaid it had launched an attack on US
OL,10,Fmilitary targets in Jordan, according
OL,11,Fto Iranian state media.
OL,13,FThe BBC has approached Centcom for
OL,14,Fcomment.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
